        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "OPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 3RD OF OCTOBER 12 NOON TO 12:30. \nNo. 51 Cuan Glas, Bishop O' Donnell Road, is a beautiful 3 bed detached home in a wonderful condition, ready to walk into, and in pristine decorative order throughout. Featuring oil fired central heating, double glazing, luxury ensuite off master bedroom, fantastic kitchen fully fitted, and downstairs WC and WHB. High standard of tiling in kitchen and bathroom areas.\n\nSituated close to the university, hospital, several schools, local shops, Salthill Promenade, and enjoys easy access to city centre. Ample off street parking to front. Overlooking lovely green area.\n\nComprising: entrance hallway, sitting room with fireplace, kitchen/ breakfast room fully fitted. Downstairs WC and WHB. Upstairs 3 superb bedrooms. Ensuite off master bedroom plus main bathroom WC and WHB. Excellent tiling throughout. Lovely front garden. Side entrance also.\n\nNo. 51 is a brilliantly located property in pristine condition in a fantastic residential district. Viewing of 51 Cuan Glas is highly recommended.\n\nDetails and viewings with John Quinn. 091 569 174. \n"
